    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Well-differentiated neuroendocrine tumour (NET), oncocytic type",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Oncocytic well-differentiated NET is composed of single dispersed cells with abundant eccentric granular cytoplasm and round to oval nuclei with increased mitotic activity (Giemsa).",
    "source": "Michelle D. Reid",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
