    "title": "<p>Immunocytochemical and genetic alterations in G3&nbsp;pancreatic neuroendocrine tumour (PanNET) compared with pancreatic neuroendocrine carcinoma (PanNEC)</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Barbara Ann Centeno",
